The server will be down for maintenance on March 11th around 10:30 pm PST (6:30 am GMT and 9:30 am MSK). We will send you 30 coupons as the compensation afterwards.  

[b]What’s New[/b]

[b]1. New Content[/b]
- Added Team Preset function. Players can quick-dispatch preset teams for Exploration Expeditions, or switch teams in Role Page and Arena;
- New fashions added for these mercenaries: Canida Luna - Cheongsam, Beck - Gaze into the Abyss, and Lili - Maid of Meow;

[b]2. Function Optimization[/b]
- Optimized the League Search function. The league list will now be smartly ordered based on league levels, activity time, time of creation, and number of remained member spots, etc;
- Optimized the rules for level advance. As long as the map isn’t changing, players will not be transferred while advancing into new floors. Instead, players will keep running with a notification of getting into new floors shown on the screen;
- Optimized the mechanism of Mine Expedition to decrease the difficulty for league leaders to manage the league: Other members will be able to pick mining targets. Note that once a member picks the target, the others will not be able to change it;
- Optimized the rules of registration. In case a league forgets to register and miss a league activity, each league will be registered automatically as long as it has members online during the registration phase;
- Optimized the display of character models;
- Moved Synergy into each mercenary’s page in Role, so that it’s easier for players to operate;

[b]3. Bug Fixed[/b]
- Fixed the bug that might cause offline problems for some players.
- Fixed the problem that scrolling stops working in chat if received league messages.


