The server will be down for maintenance on November 26th around 12am PST (8am GMT and 11am MSK). The maintenance will last for about two and half an hour. We will send you 30 coupons as the compensation afterwards. 

[b]What’s New[/b]

[b]1. New Content[/b]
- Restore the hint for new players while there are functions to unlock. Will be located under the level info. Also, perfected the function unlocking.

[b]2. Function Optimization[/b]
- Adjusted some of the sound effect and volume to enhance the fighting experience;
- Decreased the level required for unlocking Time Leaping. From level 420 to level 270;
- Increased the difficulty for floors before level 210;
- Added red dot when there are diamonds to receive in Mercenary Index;
- Optimized the notification of battle starts and battle reports. From overlaying the other pages to the bottom.

[b]3. Bug Fixed[/b]
- Fixed the bug that players can’t finish the 7-day goal of runes by getting runes from Hidden Secret Area and Artifact Ruins;
- Fixed the bug where the loading problem of Mercenary Index might cause the game to crash;
- Fixed part of the bug that caused the game to close itself;
- Fixed the bug that new players got stuck after the second time rewind;
- Fixed the bug that achievement page won’t refresh after players get new equipment by customizing; 
- Fixed the problem that some players who bought the previous drink pack could not login the game;
- Fixed the problem that some high level players might be mistakenly detected by the system as cheating after each rewind.


