The server will be down for maintenance on[b] September 17th around 1am PDT (9am BST and 11am MSK).[/b] The maintenance will last for about [b]two and half an hour.[/b] We will send you [b]30 coupons[/b] as the compensation afterwards. 

[b]What’s New[/b]

[b]1. Function Optimization[/b]
- The display of setting is now from continuous to single pages so that players can save time;
- Optimized the pop-up information after losing to a boss. Now it will pop-up every time after a lost boss fight instead of showing after three failed attempts. Players can choose to block it from popping up;
- Optimized the display of [b][i]time energy[/i][/b] in [b][i]time control[/i][/b];
- The requirement for unlocking [i][b]Auto Fuse function[/b][/i] is now [i][b]Fusing Equipment 10 Times Manually[/b][/i] instead of [i][b]Fusing to Get the First Epic Equipment[/b][/i];
- Adjust the order of [i][b]artifact page[/b][/i] and [i][b]info page[/b][/i] of the main character, and the order of[i][b] skill page[/b][/i] and[i][b] info page[/b][/i] of mercenaries;
- Optimized the clicking effect while clicking in the main user-interface;
- Opening the [i][b]role page[/b][/i] when it has red dot will lead players to the specific landing page;
- After evolving a mercenary, the mercenary list will no longer refresh and move to the top;
- Optimized the display of [i][b]resource backpack[/b][/i]. Can show more types of resources now.

[i][b]2. New Content[/b][/i]
- Chatroom will now show the time of each message
- Players will now get [b]1000 extra time energy[/b] after killing a boss for the first time. (Won’t work for the same boss after a rewind)

[b]3. Bug Fixed[/b]
- Fixed some text errors in the explanation of some functional buttons;
- Fixed the bug that some players can keep using the first skill while playing the [i][b]Golden Woods[/b][/i]


